[BLAME] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver/pretense/semver_solver_impl_pretense.py: While the test suite was updated to add comprehensive unit tests and real transition dispatches for parse_version, compare_precedence, and basic parse_range expressions, test coverage remains deficient for several relational wildcard syntax requirements defined in the low-level specification: parse_range and satisfies specifications require validating and evaluating standalone wildcard tokens when paired with relational comparators (specifically greater-than-or-equal, less-than-or-equal, strictly greater-than, strictly less-than, and not-equal operators), as well as evaluating the not-equal relational operator across major-level and minor-level wildcard range expressions. The test suite currently lacks unit test cases and transition assertions exercising these relational wildcard operator combinations against the public parse_range and satisfies APIs.
